00:19:58.300 --> 00:20:01.680
So, what do you think
of this year's new students, Saegusa?

00:20:01.680 --> 00:20:03.390
There are some fascinating kids.

00:20:03.390 --> 00:20:04.680
Two, no less!

00:20:07.440 --> 00:20:11.690
Aside from those siblings,
there were a few other students of note.

00:20:11.690 --> 00:20:13.940
We have a bumper crop this year, right?

00:20:13.940 --> 00:20:17.030
I'm sure you'll find
a lot to like, too, Jumonji.

00:20:18.030 --> 00:20:21.280
Does it look like you'll be
able to achieve your goal?

00:20:21.280 --> 00:20:23.490
I'd say so.

00:20:23.490 --> 00:20:26.580
I think these kids
could make it interesting.

00:20:26.580 --> 00:20:28.330
Course 1 and Course 2...

00:20:28.330 --> 00:20:33.170
It will be a sight to see how they'll make
their respective positions count.

00:20:33.170 --> 00:20:37.930
I'm not sure what you mean, but if you say so,
that's probably how it'll turn out.

00:20:37.930 --> 00:20:40.590
He just doesn't seem like a stranger.

00:20:40.590 --> 00:20:43.970
It might be just be me
who has this sense of destiny.

00:20:57.860 --> 00:20:59.280
Brother...

00:21:22.220 --> 00:21:23.600
Um...

00:21:25.810 --> 00:21:28.480
Um, may I join you?

00:21:28.480 --> 00:21:30.810
You bet!

00:21:30.810 --> 00:21:34.730
Ms. Shiba! Shizuku! Over here!

00:21:34.730 --> 00:21:36.070
Let's go.

00:21:41.200 --> 00:21:43.990
Miyuki...

00:21:43.990 --> 00:21:45.530
Brother...

00:21:50.870 --> 00:21:53.000
Thank you, Honoka.

00:21:53.000 --> 00:21:55.790
Huh? "H-H-Honoka"?

00:21:55.790 --> 00:22:00.800
Remember what my brother said?
You can call me Miyuki, too.

00:22:00.800 --> 00:22:04.600
You can call me Miyuki...
Call me Miyuki... Call me Miyuki...

00:22:04.600 --> 00:22:05.170
Honoka?

00:22:05.170 --> 00:22:05.680
Hey!

00:22:05.680 --> 00:22:06.420
Come on!

00:22:06.420 --> 00:22:08.640
It's all good. She's always like this.

00:22:08.640 --> 00:22:11.350
Isn't that a problem in itself?

00:22:11.350 --> 00:22:15.980
Ms. Shiba's going to call me Honoka,
and I'm going to call her Miyuki.
